  "changes": [
    "Reviewed trigger scopes invalidate only dependent outputs. A rule must match the pinned reference or explicit native adapter; unknown attachments and altered descriptions remain uncomputed.",
    "Pomander/Nutritious Soup affect acquisition and Prayer Wheel affects rewards. Resulting card enchantments are still independently checked.",
    "Permafrost has no effect without a Power in the prefix. With a Power, the unexported private activation flag prevents a fixed Block/HP prediction, while independent enemy damage remains computable.",
    "Slither current native cost is the resolved draw result. Entangled cost is already included by Tangled; its power amount is a surcharge, and the entire power/afflictions clear at owner-side turn end, not a countdown.",
    "Enemy Territorial gains Strength after its current attack. The observed attack is not increased a second time.",
    "Expect a Fight uses native Block and preceding positive-clamped Strength deltas, including upgraded coefficients and Frail rounding bounds. Native missing previews remain unknown.",
    "Perfected Strike uses native calculated target damage; ordinary movement between all five combat piles does not change its Strike count. Creation/removal/transform rules still require coverage or observation. Iron Wave uses native Block and damage, with uncomputed reactions remaining unknown.",
    "Actual action audit now checks stable Block and caps removed HP at target HP, rather than mislabeling overkill damage as an error."
  ],
